  "text": "proprium.sancti-matthiae-apostoli-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Saint Matthias the Apostle” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "O God, who didst join blessed Matthias to the company of Thy Apostles, grant, we beseech Thee, that through his intercession we may always feel the tenderness of Thy mercy toward us. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
